        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Heaven Is a Playground\n- People: Rick Telander, Randall Fried, Michael Warren, D.B. Sweeney, Victor Love, Bo Kimble, Richard Jordan, Janet Julian\n- Roles: writer, director, actor\n- Organizations: New York Shakespeare Festival\n- Topics: stage, screen, television, Broadway, Off Broadway\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Jordan was born as Robert Anson Jordan, Jr. on July 19, 1937, and he was an American stage, screen, and television actor.\n- Richard Jordan was a long-time member of the New York Shakespeare Festival, and he performed in many Off Broadway and Broadway plays.\n- Heaven Is a Playground is a 1991 film based on Rick Telander's book of the same name.\n- Randall Fried wrote and directed Heaven Is a Playground.\n- Heaven Is a Playground stars Michael Warren, D.B. Sweeney, Victor Love, Bo Kimble, Richard Jordan, and Janet Julian.\n- Rick Telander has a cameo appearance in Heaven Is a Playground.\n- Richard Jordan died on August 30, 1993.",
